{"id":"1bf08663c5cd2b32","group":"67","path":"67/67-thm-simultaneous-incompleteness.md","title":"Simultaneous Independence","display":"thm-simultaneous-incompleteness — Simultaneous Independence","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-thm-simultaneous-incompleteness","aliases":["67-thm-simultaneous-incompleteness"],"display":"thm-simultaneous-incompleteness — Simultaneous Independence","depends_on":["[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]","[[67-df-sentence]]","[[67-df-prim-provability]]"],"source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"source_chapter":2,"source_label":"Theorem 3; Lemma 1","source_printed_pages":25,"source_pdf_pages":36,"source_proof_status":"陈述已核对；未独立完成全部基础事实或原书证明的形式验证"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-thm-simultaneous-incompleteness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-thm-simultaneous-incompleteness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-simultaneous-incompleteness — Simultaneous Independence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"854772391cef4007\" href=\"?note=854772391cef4007\" title=\"67-df-sentence\">67-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"573b4c635ea6d91f\" href=\"?note=573b4c635ea6d91f\" title=\"67-df-prim-provability\">67-df-prim-provability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"source_label","html":"Theorem 3; Lemma 1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"25"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"36"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"陈述已核对；未独立完成全部基础事实或原书证明的形式验证"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\((T_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 是算术理论族，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_k\\supseteq Q\">\\(T_k\\supseteq Q\\)</span> 一致；所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_k\">\\(T_k\\)</span> 的公理成员关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{(k,g(\\varphi)):\\varphi\\in T_k\\}\">\\(\\{(k,g(\\varphi)):\\varphi\\in T_k\\}\\)</span> 递归可枚举。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>每个理论选定有效呈示，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span> 与句子见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"854772391cef4007\" href=\"?note=854772391cef4007\" title=\"67-df-sentence\">67-df-sentence</a>；可推导性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"573b4c635ea6d91f\" href=\"?note=573b4c635ea6d91f\" title=\"67-df-prim-provability\">67-df-prim-provability</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g=\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(g=\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> 表示上述固定自然原始递归句法编号；句法对象与自然数编码、对象语言数词分别使用。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\theta\\in\\Pi_1\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\quad\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\ (T_k\\nvdash\\theta\\land T_k\\nvdash\\neg\\theta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\theta\\in\\Pi_1\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\quad\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\ (T_k\\nvdash\\theta\\land T_k\\nvdash\\neg\\theta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 2.3, p.25。将各 Th(T_k) 的并作为 r.e. 且与 Q 逐句相容的集合，应用该页 Lemma 1 的 Rosser 变体，构造 θ 与 ¬θ 均不在并中。只有每个 T_k 可枚举还不够，必须是统一 r.e. 家族；前提已显式写明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"854772391cef4007","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-prim-provability","status":"resolved","id":"573b4c635ea6d91f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-prim-provability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"每个理论选定有效呈示，$\\Pi_1$ 与句子见 [[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]、[[67-df-sentence]]；可推导性见 [[67-df-prim-provability]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"854772391cef4007","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"每个理论选定有效呈示，$\\Pi_1$ 与句子见 [[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]、[[67-df-sentence]]；可推导性见 [[67-df-prim-provability]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-prim-provability","status":"resolved","id":"573b4c635ea6d91f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"每个理论选定有效呈示，$\\Pi_1$ 与句子见 [[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]、[[67-df-sentence]]；可推导性见 [[67-df-prim-provability]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(T_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"T_k\\supseteq Q","display":false},{"tex":"T_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\{(k,g(\\varphi)):\\varphi\\in T_k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_1","display":false},{"tex":"g=\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists\\theta\\in\\Pi_1\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\quad\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\ (T_k\\nvdash\\theta\\land T_k\\nvdash\\neg\\theta).","display":true}],"bytes":1663,"backlinks":[{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-176","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-thm-simultaneous-incompleteness]]"}],"outgoing":["851cd80e64893935","854772391cef4007","573b4c635ea6d91f"]}